{"title": "Ancient Altar (Shar)", "pageid": 56307, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ancient_Altar_(Shar)", "categories": ["Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_Altar_(Balthazar)\" title=\"Ancient Altar (Balthazar)\">Ancient Altar (Balthazar)</a>        </div>       <aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><div class=\"pi-media-collection\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<ul class=\"pi-media-collection-tabs\">\n\t\t<li class=\"pi-tab-link pi-item-spacing current\" data-pi-tab=\"pi-tab-1\">In-game</li><li class=\"pi-tab-link pi-item-spacing\" data-pi-tab=\"pi-tab-2\">In-game (Alt)</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-media-collection-tab-content current\" id=\"pi-tab-1\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Ancient_Altar_%28Shar%29.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"In-game\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Ancient_Altar_%28Shar%29.png/300px-Ancient_Altar_%28Shar%29.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Ancient_Altar_%28Shar%29.png/300px-Ancient_Altar_%28Shar%29.png.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Ancient_Altar_%28Shar%29.png/599px-Ancient_Altar_%28Shar%29.png.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"In-game\" width=\"270\" height=\"206\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-media-collection-tab-content\" id=\"pi-tab-2\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/Ancient_Altar_%28Shar%29_Lower.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"In-game (Alt)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Ancient_Altar_%28Shar%29_Lower.png/300px-Ancient_Altar_%28Shar%29_Lower.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Ancient_Altar_%28Shar%29_Lower.png/300px-Ancient_Altar_%28Shar%29_Lower.png.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Ancient_Altar_%28Shar%29_Lower.png/600px-Ancient_Altar_%28Shar%29_Lower.png.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"In-game (Alt)\" width=\"270\" height=\"227\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n</div></aside>\n<b>Ancient Altar</b> is an environmental object in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. It blocks progress until <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Umbral_Gem\" title=\"Umbral Gem\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Umbral_Gem_Icon.png/20px-Umbral_Gem_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Umbral_Gem_Icon.png/30px-Umbral_Gem_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Umbral_Gem_Icon.png/40px-Umbral_Gem_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Umbral_Gem_Icon.png/20px-Umbral_Gem_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Umbral_Gem_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Umbral_Gem\" title=\"Umbral Gem\">Umbral Gems</a> are inserted in their slots.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Two Ancient Altars are inside the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_Shar\" title=\"Gauntlet of Shar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gauntlet of Shar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_Shar\" title=\"Gauntlet of Shar\">Gauntlet of Shar</a>. One is located in the upper area north of the entrance of the Gauntlet. The other is in the lower area.\n</p><p>The first altar, the one in the upper area, has two slots which can be filled with <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Umbral_Gem\" title=\"Umbral Gem\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Umbral_Gem_Icon.png/20px-Umbral_Gem_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Umbral_Gem_Icon.png/30px-Umbral_Gem_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Umbral_Gem_Icon.png/40px-Umbral_Gem_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Umbral_Gem_Icon.png/20px-Umbral_Gem_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Umbral_Gem_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Umbral_Gem\" title=\"Umbral Gem\">Umbral Gems</a>. One slot is already pre-filled; inserting another gem unlocks a platform which can be used to travel down. It stands atop a Pedestal of Reckoning, which can be interacted with, reading the following:\n</p>\n<ul><li><i>\"Brave the Gauntlet of your Lady Shar. Surmount her trials, and rise a Dark Justiciar.\"</i></li></ul>\n<p>Further interaction with it grants additional background information and serves as a trigger of dialogue with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a> if she is present.\n</p><p>The second altar, the one in the lower area, has three slots which also must filled with umbral gems. Doing so unlocks access to <a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_Shar#The_Verge_of_Shadows\" title=\"Gauntlet of Shar\">The Verge of Shadows</a>.\n</p><p>After inserting umbral gems, the altar lights up and cannot be interacted with further.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<p>The first altar has been reported to fail to activate the platform.  The exact trigger for this unknown. If it fails to activate, a prior save (usually before having collected any umbral gems) is needed to avoid the bug. As this bug bricks the game, it may be advisable to have several saves while in the Gauntlet of Shar.\n</p><p>It is possible to still activate the first platform if an orb is placed on the ground and then manually moved into the insert box.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_quests\">Related quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Ketheric_Thorm%27s_Relic\" title=\"Find Ketheric Thorm's Relic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Ketheric Thorm's Relic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Find_Ketheric_Thorm%27s_Relic\" title=\"Find Ketheric Thorm's Relic\">Find Ketheric Thorm's Relic</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714233352\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.099 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.103 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4465/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40181/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16071/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1807/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.030/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1074974/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   96.190      1 -total\n 74.40%   71.570      1 Template:Infobox_creature\n 38.21%   36.755      1 Template:Infobox_creature/internal\n 32.20%   30.970      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.82%   13.290      2 Template:SmRarityItem\n 11.72%   11.273      2 Template:Item_icon\n 11.15%   10.728      1 Template:Template_style\n  6.51%    6.261     52 Template:Plus_if_pos\n  5.85%    5.630     28 Template:Trim\n  5.25%    5.050      3 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:56307-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714233352 and revision id 401532. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}